38px}.amx-about-hero__object{min-height:290px}.amx-about-hero h1{max-width:11ch}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"amx-about-hero\">\n<div class=\"amx-about-hero__copy\"><small data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}About Amoura{% else %}O Amoura{% endif %}</small><h1 data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}Pleasure does not have an expiry date.{% else %}Przyjemność nie ma daty ważności.{% endif %}</h1><p data-amoura-reveal>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}Amoura is being created for mature women who want to choose themselves without shame, pressure or turning every intimate need into a problem to fix. We bring knowledge, community and carefully selected products into one calm experience.{% else %}Amoura powstaje dla dojrzałych kobiet, które chcą wybierać siebie bez wstydu, presji i zamieniania każdej intymnej potrzeby w problem do rozwiązania. Łączymy wiedzę, społeczność i starannie wybrane produkty w jedno spokojne doświadczenie.{% endif %}</p></div>\n<div class=\"amx-about-hero__object\" data-amoura-mask><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--a\" data-amoura-parallax></div><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--b\"></div><div class=\"amx-about-hero__plane amx-about-hero__plane--c\"></div></div>\n</section>",
